  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Skeleton",
    "Description",
    "Loading placeholder that mirrors the shape of incoming content. Show only when content will appear within ~1s.",
    "Types",
    "text          Horizontal line. Use for paragraphs, labels, table cells.\ncircle        For avatars and circular icons.\nrectangular   For cards, thumbnails, and image containers.",
    "Sizes",
    "sm   Small inline elements (chip, row metadata).\nmd   Body text, cards, standard thumbnails.\nlg   Hero images, large cards, dashboard tiles.",
    "Motion & A11y",
    "Animate with a subtle shimmer or pulse — never a hard flash.\nPair aria-busy=true on the wrapping region.\nRespect prefers-reduced-motion: fall back to a static placeholder.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Match shape and size of final content\nDO   Use for loads expected within ~1s\nDO   Pair aria-busy on the wrapping region\nDO   Respect prefers-reduced-motion",
    "DON'T   Use for indeterminate long loads (use ProgressBar)\nDON'T   Stack skeletons without layout hierarchy\nDON'T   Animate at high contrast — stay subtle\nDON'T   Replace error or empty states with Skeleton"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
